  "prefLabel": "Cor 101.22 Protective custody",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 101.22 “Protective custody” means a status provided for in the classification handbook, which separates those persons under departmental control likely to become victims in prison from other persons under departmental control pursuant to rules enumerated in Cor 400.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Cor 100) #7446, eff 2-6-01; ss by #12500, eff 3-23-18 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cor 100)",
